# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# React Router owns every path (/admin/coverage, /judge/evaluate/12, …) but those files do
# not exist on disk. Without this rule Pages returns its own 404 on a refresh or a pasted
# deep link, and the app only works if you always enter through "/".
#
# 200 (rewrite) rather than 302: the URL must stay as typed so the router can read it.
/*    /index.html   200
